          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="9b33be85-3958-5cbc-a989-b9c451d3b9d4" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="9d6a53e9-e49d-4c52-8fd5-5b2373c10d20" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 2 · Starboard: 2 · Prow Ordnance: 2 · Dorsal: 2 · Defence: 4</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="973ef189-4f99-4060-b1c2-1323f0408d50" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="12fc1ef3-fe5b-4688-9243-5b756897f5e6" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 5 · Port 2 · Starboard 2 · Prow Ordnance 2 · Dorsal 2 · Defence 4. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <categoryLinks>
